---
import { icon } from '../../lib/icons.js';
import DemonstrationCard from '../DemonstrationCard.astro';
---

<section id="setup" class="section" aria-labelledby="setup-title">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <h2 id="setup-title">01 Agent and Harness</h2>
    <div class="report-prose">
      <p>
        GPT-6-Astra controls the robot through an agent harness that returns the same RGB views and
        proprioception that post-trained policies receive. Under <strong>direct control</strong>,
        the agent commands end-effector waypoints itself. In the{' '}
        <strong>harness with policy</strong>, it can also invoke π₀.₅ or InternW0-Δ, which then acts
        for 1 to 300 physics steps. For each task, the agent receives one annotated demonstration
        derived from a single training episode, and the evaluation covers all 26 test tasks and 510
        test episodes of EBench.
      </p>
    </div>
    <figure class="paper-figure" id="fig-overview">
      <img
        src="media/figures/overview.webp"
        alt="The GPT-6-Astra control loop on EBench and executor timelines of a Microwave episode under direct control and in the harness with π₀.₅"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
      <figcaption>
        The GPT-6-Astra control loop on EBench and the executor along one Microwave test episode
        under direct control and in the harness with π₀.₅, with blue segments executed by the agent
        and purple segments by π₀.₅.
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
    <DemonstrationCard />
    <div class="explorer-links">
      <a
        href="https://internrobotics.github.io/EBench-doc/evaluation/task-showcase/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
      >
        Explore EBench tasks <Fragment set:html={icon('external-link')} />
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
